{
 "encounter_id": "00857",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. I'm Bimla, I look after Mrs Mehta every day, and she's got this cough and she keeps clearing her throat. It's driving us both mad."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Namaste, doctor. Yes, doctor. This cough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been, Mrs Mehta?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since the pneumonia, doctor. After the hospital. Three months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She had a chest infection in July, and ever since, she's been clearing her throat, all day, and coughing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it a dry cough, or does it bring up phlegm?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dry, mostly. A tickle in the throat. And the throat clearing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When is it worst?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "After meals. And lying down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day, and a blood pressure tablet, amlodipine, 5 mg."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other health conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She had pneumonia, as I said. And high blood pressure. And her thyroid, she had an operation on it, in 2005."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me ask about the operation. What was it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Half her thyroid taken out, in 2005."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does she smoke or drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No. Never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse, pressure, and so on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I've taken them, doctor. Pulse 78, blood pressure 138 over 82, oxygen 97 percent, temperature 36.6, weight 58 kilos."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Mrs Mehta, I'll listen to your chest and look in your throat. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, doctor.",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your chest is clear, and your throat is slightly red at the back, with some cobblestoning, but nothing worrying."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is it the lungs? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The chest X-ray they did in hospital after pneumonia was clear, and so is my examination today. The pattern, a dry tickly cough, throat clearing, worse after meals and lying down, makes me think of reflux, silent reflux, or a post-infection cough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Reflux, doctor? I have no heartburn. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can happen without heartburn. We call it laryngopharyngeal reflux. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Can she take something? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "She's already on omeprazole once a day. I'd like to increase it to twice a day, and see if that helps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to arrange a blood test, to check your thyroid and blood count, because of the operation, and a repeat chest X-ray, and a breathing test, to be thorough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Over the next two weeks. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Avoid eating late, raise the head of the bed, and avoid spicy food, tea and coffee after lunch."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see her again in four weeks. If she coughs up blood, loses weight, or gets breathless, come back sooner."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
